14:["$","p",null,{"className":"reading-policy","children":"Idea Reconstruction 是从已知背景出发的推演，不代表作者真实心理过程。Follow-up 是研究提案；相关工作比较不等于已证实 Novelty。教学示例与原文案例在正文中区分。"}]
15:["$","details",null,{"className":"mobile-contents","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"Contents · 12 Questions"}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"移动端论文目录","children":[["$","a","problem",{"href":"#problem","children":["01"," ","Research Problem & Background"]}],["$","a","prior-work",{"href":"#prior-work","children":["02"," ","Prior Work & Research Gap"]}],["$","a","idea-reconstruction",{"href":"#idea-reconstruction","children":["03"," ","Idea Reconstruction"]}],["$","a","intuition",{"href":"#intuition","children":["04"," ","Core Intuition"]}],["$","a","method",{"href":"#method","children":["05"," ","Method & Worked Example"]}],["$","a","mathematics",{"href":"#mathematics","children":["06"," ","Mathematical Foundations"]}],["$","a","experiments",{"href":"#experiments","children":["07"," ","Experiments & Claims"]}],["$","a","takeaways",{"href":"#takeaways","children":["08"," ","Takeaways"]}],["$","a","assumptions",{"href":"#assumptions","children":["09"," ","Most Fragile Assumption"]}],["$","a","reproduction",{"href":"#reproduction","children":["10"," ","One-Week Reproduction"]}],["$","a","counterexample",{"href":"#counterexample","children":["11"," ","Counterexample Design"]}],["$","a","follow-up",{"href":"#follow-up","children":["12"," ","Follow-up Research"]}]]}]]}]
16:["$","div",null,{"className":"reading-sections","children":[["$","section","problem",{"id":"problem","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Research Problem & Background"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"问题为什么重要，解决它有什么价值？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"自动 post-training 研究常把数据判断和系统工程混在一起，难以单独辨认 Agent 的数据研究能力。论文考察在训练工具与预算固定后，Agent 能否诊断能力缺口、设计数据并根据 model feedback 继续改进。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: RSIBench-Data: Benchmarking Data-Centric Research for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Data-centric Research 的难点是从 Model 失败诊断训练数据缺口，再决定生成、过滤和混合什么数据。若允许同时修改训练服务与推理栈，很难知道收益来自研究策略还是实现技巧。RSIBench-Data 固定基础设施，隔离数据研究决策。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: RSIBench-Data: Benchmarking Data-Centric Research for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}],["$","section","prior-work",{"id":"prior-work","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Prior Work & Research Gap"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"前人做到哪一步，缺口在哪里？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-prior","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-prior","children":"Prior Work"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Self-Instruct 展示合成 Instruction Data，The AI Scientist 展示自动实验，MLE-bench 测端到端工程。RSIBench-Data 让 Agent 多轮提交数据策略，用统一 SFT 与 Evaluation 服务返回反馈，从而更集中地测量数据选择如何改变目标 Model。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2410.07095",{"href":"#reference-2410.07095","aria-label":"来源 2: MLE-bench: Evaluating Machine Learning Agents on Machine Learning Engineering","children":["[",2,"]"]}],["$","a","2408.06292",{"href":"#reference-2408.06292","aria-label":"来源 3: The AI Scientist: Towards Fully Automated Open-Ended Scientific Discovery","children":["[",3,"]"]}],["$","a","2212.10560",{"href":"#reference-2212.10560","aria-label":"来源 4: Self-Instruct: Aligning Language Models with Self-Generated Instructions","children":["[",4,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}],["$","section","idea-reconstruction",{"id":"idea-reconstruction","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Idea Reconstruction"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从已有知识与失败模式出发，如何走到这个想法？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"一个 Model 失败可能来自知识缺失、轨迹格式或训练覆盖；研究者应能选择不同数据干预。要比较研究者，就应统一训练后端和资源，把变化限制在可提交的数据及有限配置中。这样每轮 Checkpoint 的变化才能更直接地关联到数据策略。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2410.07095",{"href":"#reference-2410.07095","aria-label":"来源 2: MLE-bench: Evaluating Machine Learning Agents on Machine Learning Engineering","children":["[",2,"]"]}],["$","a","2408.06292",{"href":"#reference-2408.06292","aria-label":"来源 3: The AI Scientist: Towards Fully Automated Open-Ended Scientific Discovery","children":["[",3,"]"]}],["$","a","2212.10560",{"href":"#reference-2212.10560","aria-label":"来源 4: Self-Instruct: Aligning Language Models with Self-Generated Instructions","children":["[",4,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}],["$","section","intuition",{"id":"intuition","children":[[["$","span","insight",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"insight"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"04"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Core Intuition"}],"$L1b",["$L1c"]]}]]}],"$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24"]}]
