1c:["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"迭代中的最好成绩和最后一次成绩应分开记录。本站解读：若选择与保留机制不能守住较好版本，即使 search 曾发现有用数据 strategy，也无法把研究收益稳定转化成可持续的系统改进。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: RSIBench-Data: Benchmarking Data-Centric Research for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]
1d:["$","section","method",{"id":"method","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"05"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Method & Worked Example"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"沿着输入、处理、输出走完 Pipeline。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"固定目标 model、post-training 流程、服务与评测环境，让 Agent 在相同预算下迭代调整数据 strategy。对 model checkpoint feedback 和完整研究轨迹进行比较，从而把数据研究决策与底层训练工程尽可能分离。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: RSIBench-Data: Benchmarking Data-Centric Research for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"原文 Pipeline：Agent 获得任务描述、允许的公共 Seed、工具 Schema 和预算，提交符合数据契约的训练产物；统一服务从固定 M₀ 训练 LoRA Checkpoint，固定环境评价后返回允许信号；Agent 决定是否继续及怎样修订策略。Filtering、Curriculum 和 Mixing 是研究者的可选决策，原文没有规定每轮必须依次执行这些步骤。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: RSIBench-Data: Benchmarking Data-Centric Research for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1e:["$","section","mathematics",{"id":"mathematics","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"06"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Mathematical Foundations"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从符号、直觉与简单例子理解理论。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"可将一轮看成 D_t→Train(M₀,D_t)→M_t→Eval(M_t)。每次从同一 M₀ 训练，减少前轮参数累积的混淆；研究者通过反馈改变下一轮 D。目标 Model 改善与研究者自身 Policy 更新仍是不同事件，数据策略多轮变化不能自动证明研究者的 Model 已学习。"}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"math-block","aria-label":"数学表达式","children":"M_t = FixedTrain(M₀, D_t, bounded config_t)\nfeedback_t = FixedEval(M_t)\nD_(t+1) = Researcher(history, feedback_t)"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: RSIBench-Data: Benchmarking Data-Centric Research for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1f:["$","section","experiments",{"id":"experiments","children":[[["$","span","results",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"results"}],["$","span","observation",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"observation"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"07"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Experiments & Claims"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"Research Question → Experiment → Answer"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Question：Agent 能否根据 Checkpoint Feedback 改善数据策略？→ Experiment：在多个任务和研究 Agent 上固定训练、服务与资源，比较初次有效尝试和后续结果。→ Answer：作者报告部分设置有迭代收益，同时存在策略失效与任务差异；结果测的是受约束的数据研究能力。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: RSIBench-Data: Benchmarking Data-Centric Research for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"四种 Agent 在六项 benchmark 上的实验中，58.33% 的设置优于首个有效尝试。在达到最好成绩后仍继续 search 的轨迹中，78.26% 最终低于该最好成绩；后一个比例的分母不是全部实验设置。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: RSIBench-Data: Benchmarking Data-Centric Research for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
20:["$","section","takeaways",{"id":"takeaways","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"08"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Takeaways"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"这篇论文改变了哪些判断？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"这项 Benchmark 的价值在于固定服务边界。判断改进要保存每轮数据、配置、Checkpoint 和反馈，而不能只展示最佳最终分数。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: RSIBench-Data: Benchmarking Data-Centric Research for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
21:["$","section","assumptions",{"id":"assumptions","children":[[["$","span","limits",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"limits"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"09"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Most Fragile Assumption"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"哪一个假设失效会动摇方法？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"最脆弱的假设是允许的诊断反馈足以指出可由数据修复的瓶颈。真实问题也可能来自 Model Capacity 或训练算法，固定后端下再优化数据可能无法解决。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: RSIBench-Data: Benchmarking Data-Centric Research for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"这些实验支持数据研究存在可获得的收益，也显示轨迹回退，但不能证明任意数据 strategy 或 model 都能改善。基础设施与目标 model 固定，此条目仅核验摘要，不能据此判断每类错误的精确因果贡献。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: RSIBench-Data: Benchmarking Data-Centric Research for Recursive Self-Improvement · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
22:["$","section","reproduction",{"id":"reproduction","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"10"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"One-Week Reproduction"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"用一周检验一个最小且明确的命题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Day 1–2：固定一个小 Model 与 LoRA 配置，准备诊断和隐藏任务。Day 3–5：允许三轮数据生成，每轮从 M₀ 重训，限制相同训练 Token。Day 6–7：比较首轮、最终轮和合并数据策略，检查反馈是否被违规转成测试标签。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
23:["$","section","counterexample",{"id":"counterexample","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"11"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Counterexample Design"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"如何构造有辨识力的反例？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"构造一个超过目标 Model 表达能力的任务，同时让诊断表面上像数据不足。若 Agent 持续生成更多相似样本而无收益，就能检测其是否知道何时应停止数据研究。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
24:["$","section","follow-up",{"id":"follow-up","children":[[["$","span","outlook",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"outlook"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"12"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Follow-up Research"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从缺陷与需求推导新的研究问题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"研究数据干预的可解性判据：Agent 通过少量对照训练区分数据不足、优化失败和能力限制，只有在证据支持时继续生成数据。相对 Self-Instruct 的数据扩展，这将研究目标转成瓶颈识别与资源决策，关键结果是避免无效训练并预测跨任务干预收益。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2410.07095",{"href":"#reference-2410.07095","aria-label":"来源 2: MLE-bench: Evaluating Machine Learning Agents on Machine Learning Engineering","children":["[",2,"]"]}],["$","a","2408.06292",{"href":"#reference-2408.06292","aria-label":"来源 3: The AI Scientist: Towards Fully Automated Open-Ended Scientific Discovery","children":["[",3,"]"]}],["$","a","2212.10560",{"href":"#reference-2212.10560","aria-label":"来源 4: Self-Instruct: Aligning Language Models with Self-Generated Instructions","children":["[",4,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
